(7386361, 1149209, 46918, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club...<br/> <br/>I do enjoy the humor in this shot. There are a few things, however, that I would have liked to see. 1st of all the background is kind of boring. I understand that you were approaching this with a minimalistic view. It still would he been nice to have something other than white. Also it looks like the focus is slightly off. The two people (lego men) seem to be oof. However, the mustard jar and sword seem to be in good focus. This may have been caused by lighting. Happy shooting.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club... I do enjoy the humor in this shot. There are a few things, however, that I would have liked to see. 1st of all the background is kind of boring. I understand that you were approaching this with a minimalistic view. It still would he been nice to have something other than white. Also it looks like the focus is slightly off. The two people (lego men) seem to be oof. However, the mustard jar and sword seem to be in good focus. This may have been caused by lighting. Happy shooting.', '2015-07-13 12:19:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(7386406, 1149260, 46918, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club...<br/> <br/>Interesting idea.... The reflections in the light bulb are a bit distracting. Also I think that it is a bit dark. I know that was already commented down below but I agree. I do however, like the way you framed it. That is nicely done. Happy shooting.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club... Interesting idea.... The reflections in the light bulb are a bit distracting. Also I think that it is a bit dark. I know that was already commented down below but I agree. I do however, like the way you framed it. That is nicely done. Happy shooting.', '2015-07-13 13:27:11.000000', NULL, 0);
